---
// VideoShowcase.astro — Full-Bleed Edge-to-Edge Cinematic Video Showcase
---

<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden py-4 sm:py-6" aria-label="Présentation vidéo MATBAA LIK">
  <!-- Edge-to-edge 100% full viewport width with zero horizontal padding or margins -->
  <div class="w-full relative aspect-[1920/640] bg-[#111111] overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio: 1920 / 640;">
    <video
      autoplay
      muted
      loop
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      poster="/videos/carnets-de-factures-poster.webp"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover block select-none pointer-events-none"
    >
      <source src="/videos/carnets-de-factures.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      Votre navigateur ne prend pas en charge la lecture de vidéos HTML5.
    </video>
  </div>
</section>
